{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Dark Lord has awakened and attacked the kingdom. The King has sent you to defeat the evil enemy and free your people! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is an adventure in which you have to navigate through cells and fight enemies using logic and a sharp sword. Don't forget to select improvements that will help you advance. Food heals, potions increase the maximum amount of health, swords increase damage, and if you can find shoes, your character will start moving faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have 3 attempts to complete this difficult path. As lives end, you have to start all over again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interesting gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hordes of enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple locations</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"LEVEL 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043270/f77d4af9ef2d690587900a98b74a30eee0715213.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 5","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043270/bb7b4042092e42f9dfe345f4a70e43aa93d0eb55.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043270/d327198ab09ea3b9a8cac616be2d392ac9a77b1d.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 15","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043270/855091bc32f1b66cfdd17b3eb88d149630e320ee.jpg"},{"name":"LEVEL 20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4043270/ae80334dd960e01594f17979e0131923d4e9d8d8.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4043270?t=1760542671","background_raw":"htt